		{
			dependencies: ["27BA6EBA81622516"]
			description: [
		"&6&l» Laser Chamber"
		"&f- The laser target bin is equivalent to the more powerful &benergy bin &r&f, and the laser source bin is equivalent to the more powerful &bpower bin &r&f."
		"&f- May only be used on machines or generators marked &ein the description \"Laser Compartment Allowed\" &r&f."
		"&f- If the machine allows two laser chambers to be placed, &bdouble chamber boosting &r&fcan also be performed."
		""
		"&4&l» Important restrictions"
		"&c- Even if the machine description has the words &e\"Allows use of laser bins\" &r&c, in most cases the laser target bin cannot replace the normal energy bin in a multi-block structure."
		"&c- a few special cases:"
		"&a• &fDeep chemical distortion meter, nano-forge, etc.: Only the laser target chamber can be used, and the energy chamber cannot be used."
		"&a• &fCompression Fusion Reactor: Can replace the energy chamber with a laser target chamber."
		"&f- Please refer to the multi-block JEI interface and machine host description."
	]
